  <AltText>
    Sprite of Asherwulfy's sona, Asher. He's a wolf with dark grey and orange fur, and wears a red bandana. He has heterochromia, with the right eye being red, and the left eye being blue. A version of our art signature is present on the left, with a pawprint and 'にじ' written vertically.
  </AltText>
